# Author identity map. Copy to <migration-root>/config/authors.map and
# fill in every identity found by inspect-source-history. The filled-in
# copy contains real names and emails - keep it local, never commit it
# to this plugin.
#
# Mercurial (hg-fast-export) entry format:
#   "source identity"="Full Name <email@example.com>"
#
# SVN (git svn --authors-file) entry format:
#   loginname = Full Name <email@example.com>
#
# Policy: unknown_author_policy is "stop" - conversion refuses to guess.
# When multiple identities are plausible for one source author, the human
# decides; the agent must not infer.

# "olduser"="Example Person <example.person@example.com>"
# olduser = Example Person <example.person@example.com>
